[{"id": 1, "title": "重複結構", "chapter": "封面", "bg": "navy", "html": "\n<div style='text-align:center;padding:24px 20px;'>\n  <div style='font-size:66px;margin-bottom:14px;'>🔁</div>\n  <h1 style='font-size:2.6rem;font-weight:900;color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px;'>重複結構：迴圈</h1>\n  <h2 style='font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:400;color:#93c5fd;margin-bottom:24px;'>Repetition · for · range() · while · break</h2>\n  <div style='display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:22px;'><span style='background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);color:#e0f2fe;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:20px;'>🔢 range()</span><span style='background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);color:#e0f2fe;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:20px;'>➕ 累加器</span><span style='background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);color:#e0f2fe;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:20px;'>⭐ 雙重迴圈</span><span style='background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);color:#e0f2fe;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:20px;'>⏳ while</span></div>\n  <p style='color:#bfdbfe;font-size:1.05rem;'>城市科技 · 高一第二學期 ｜ 第 4 週</p>\n</div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 2, "title": "為什麼要迴圈", "chapter": "第一節：for 迴圈與 range()", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>😩 印 50 行 Hello Python!，你要寫 50 次 print 嗎？</h2>\n<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;'><div style='background:#1e293b;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:12px;'><div style='padding:10px 14px;'><div style='font-size:.72rem;color:#94a3b8;margin-bottom:6px;'>沒有迴圈</div><pre style='margin:0;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.6;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'>print(&quot;Hello Python!&quot;)\nprint(&quot;Hello Python!&quot;)\nprint(&quot;Hello Python!&quot;)\n# ……還要再 47 行</pre></div><div style='background:#0b1220;border-top:1px dashed #334155;padding:8px 14px;'><span style='font-size:.68rem;color:#64748b;'>▶ 執行結果</span><pre style='margin:4px 0 0;color:#a7f3d0;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.55;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'></pre></div></div>\n<div style='background:#1e293b;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:12px;'><div style='padding:10px 14px;'><div style='font-size:.72rem;color:#94a3b8;margin-bottom:6px;'>有迴圈：2 行搞定</div><pre style='margin:0;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.6;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'>for i in range(50):\n    print(&quot;Hello Python!&quot;)</pre></div><div style='background:#0b1220;border-top:1px dashed #334155;padding:8px 14px;'><span style='font-size:.68rem;color:#64748b;'>▶ 執行結果</span><pre style='margin:4px 0 0;color:#a7f3d0;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.55;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'>Hello Python!\nHello Python!\n…（共 50 行）</pre></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style='background:#eff6ff;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #2563eb;'><p style='color:#374151;font-size:.88rem;margin:0;line-height:1.7;'>💬 🔁 <strong>重複結構</strong>：重複執行某些敘述，直到滿足特定條件為止，也叫<strong>迴圈（loop）</strong>。電腦最擅長做重複又不會累的事。</p></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 3, "title": "for 語法", "chapter": "第一節：for 迴圈與 range()", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>🔢 for 迴圈語法</h2>\n<div style='background:#f1f5f9;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:14px;border-left:4px solid #0d9488;'><p style='margin:0;color:#0f172a;font-size:.93rem;line-height:1.7;'><code style='background:#e2e8f0;color:#0f172a;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.85em;'>for 變數 in range(起始值, 結束值, 間隔):</code>　→ 變數依序取 range 產生的每個數，每取一個就執行一次區塊。</p></div>\n<div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px;'><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:#f0fdf4;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;'><div style='width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#16a34a;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;flex-shrink:0;'>1</div><div><strong style='color:#166534;font-size:.88rem;'>結束值「不包含」</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.6;'>range(1, 6) 是 1～5，不是 1～6</div></div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:#f0fdf4;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;'><div style='width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#16a34a;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;flex-shrink:0;'>2</div><div><strong style='color:#166534;font-size:.88rem;'>起始值可省略</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.6;'>省略時從 0 開始：range(6) 等於 range(0, 6)</div></div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:#f0fdf4;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;'><div style='width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#16a34a;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;flex-shrink:0;'>3</div><div><strong style='color:#166534;font-size:.88rem;'>間隔可省略</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.6;'>省略時每次加 1；可以是負數（倒數）</div></div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:#f0fdf4;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;'><div style='width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#16a34a;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;flex-shrink:0;'>4</div><div><strong style='color:#166534;font-size:.88rem;'>別忘了冒號和縮排</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.6;'>和 if 一樣，迴圈區塊要縮排</div></div></div></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 4, "title": "range 實例", "chapter": "第一節：for 迴圈與 range()", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>🧪 range() 實例：先猜再看</h2>\n<table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin-bottom:12px;'><tr style='background:#1E3A5F;color:#fff;'><th style='padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;width:32%;'>寫法</th><th style='padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;width:44%;'>產生的數</th><th style='padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;width:24%;'>重複幾次</th></tr><tr style='background:#fff;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>range(6)</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>6</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8fafc;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>range(2, 6)</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>2, 3, 4, 5</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>4</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>range(2, 15, 3)</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>2, 5, 8, 11, 14</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>5</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8fafc;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>range(10, 0, -2)</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>10, 8, 6, 4, 2</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>5</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>range(1, n + 1)</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>1, 2, …, n</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>n</td></tr></table>\n<div style='background:#1e293b;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:12px;'><div style='padding:10px 14px;'><pre style='margin:0;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.6;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'>for i in range(2, 15, 3):\n    print(i, end=&quot; &quot;)</pre></div><div style='background:#0b1220;border-top:1px dashed #334155;padding:8px 14px;'><span style='font-size:.68rem;color:#64748b;'>▶ 執行結果</span><pre style='margin:4px 0 0;color:#a7f3d0;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.55;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'>2 5 8 11 14 </pre></div></div>\n<div style='background:#eff6ff;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #2563eb;'><p style='color:#374151;font-size:.88rem;margin:0;line-height:1.7;'>💬 🧮 小技巧：range(a, b) 會重複 <strong>b − a</strong> 次。</p></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 5, "title": "for 搭配字串", "chapter": "第一節：for 迴圈與 range()", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>🔤 for 也可以「走過」一串東西</h2>\n<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;'><div style='background:#1e293b;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:12px;'><div style='padding:10px 14px;'><div style='font-size:.72rem;color:#94a3b8;margin-bottom:6px;'>逐一取出字串的每個字</div><pre style='margin:0;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.6;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'>for ch in &quot;Python&quot;:\n    print(ch, end=&quot;-&quot;)</pre></div><div style='background:#0b1220;border-top:1px dashed #334155;padding:8px 14px;'><span style='font-size:.68rem;color:#64748b;'>▶ 執行結果</span><pre style='margin:4px 0 0;color:#a7f3d0;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.55;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'>P-y-t-h-o-n-</pre></div></div>\n<div style='background:#1e293b;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:12px;'><div style='padding:10px 14px;'><div style='font-size:.72rem;color:#94a3b8;margin-bottom:6px;'>逐一取出串列的每個元素（第 6 章詳細學）</div><pre style='margin:0;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.6;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'>for city in [&quot;台北&quot;, &quot;台中&quot;, &quot;高雄&quot;]:\n    print(city, &quot;加油！&quot;)</pre></div><div style='background:#0b1220;border-top:1px dashed #334155;padding:8px 14px;'><span style='font-size:.68rem;color:#64748b;'>▶ 執行結果</span><pre style='margin:4px 0 0;color:#a7f3d0;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.55;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'>台北 加油！\n台中 加油！\n高雄 加油！</pre></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style='background:#eff6ff;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #2563eb;'><p style='color:#374151;font-size:.88rem;margin:0;line-height:1.7;'>💬 📌 Python 的 for 是「<strong>對一串東西裡的每一個</strong>做事」，range() 只是其中一種「一串數字」。</p></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 6, "title": "流程圖", "chapter": "第一節：for 迴圈與 range()", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>🗺️ 計數迴圈的流程圖</h2>\n<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;'><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:0;'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='border-radius:4px;background:#dbeafe;color:#1e3a8a;width:170px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>i = 1</div></div></div><div style='width:230px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='clip-path:polygon(50% 0,100% 50%,50% 100%,0 50%);background:#fef3c7;color:#78350f;width:230px;padding:22px 26px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>i <= 5 ?</div></div><div style='font-size:.75rem;color:#b45309;font-weight:600;margin-left:10px;'>否 → 離開迴圈</div></div><div style='width:230px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='border-radius:4px;background:#dbeafe;color:#1e3a8a;width:170px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>輸出 i</div></div></div><div style='width:230px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='border-radius:4px;background:#dbeafe;color:#1e3a8a;width:170px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>i = i + 1</div></div><div style='font-size:.75rem;color:#b45309;font-weight:600;margin-left:10px;'>→ 回到判斷</div></div></div>\n<div style='background:#eff6ff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;'>🤖</div><strong style='color:#1e40af;font-size:.9rem;'>for 幫你做了三件事</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>① 設定起始值 i = 1<br>② 每次檢查是否還在範圍內<br>③ 每輪結束自動把 i 往下一個<br><br>下一節的 while 迴圈，這三件事要<strong>自己寫</strong>。</div></div></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 7, "title": "第一節 隨堂測驗", "chapter": "第一節：for 迴圈與 range()", "bg": "purple", "quiz": "q1", "html": "\n<div style='text-align:center;padding:44px 20px;'>\n  <div style='font-size:54px;margin-bottom:16px;'>📝</div>\n  <h1 style='font-size:2rem;color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px;'>第一節 隨堂測驗</h1>\n  <p style='color:#e9d5ff;font-size:1rem;'>for 迴圈與 range() ｜ 4 題</p>\n  <p style='color:#c4b5fd;font-size:.85rem;margin-top:18px;'>按「下一頁 →」開始作答</p>\n</div>\n", "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 8, "title": "累加器", "chapter": "第二節：累加與雙重迴圈", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>➕ 累加器：計算 1 + 2 + … + n</h2>\n<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;gap:12px;'><div style='background:#1e293b;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:12px;'><div style='padding:10px 14px;'><pre style='margin:0;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.6;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'>n = int(input(&quot;n=&quot;))\ntotal = 0                # ① 迴圈前先歸零\nfor i in range(1, n + 1):\n    total = total + i    # ② 每輪加上 i\nprint(&quot;1 加到&quot;, n, &quot;的和&quot;, total)</pre></div><div style='background:#0b1220;border-top:1px dashed #334155;padding:8px 14px;'><span style='font-size:.68rem;color:#64748b;'>▶ 執行結果</span><pre style='margin:4px 0 0;color:#a7f3d0;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.55;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'>n=5\n1 加到 5 的和 15</pre></div></div>\n<table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin-bottom:12px;'><tr style='background:#1E3A5F;color:#fff;'><th style='padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;width:50%;'>i</th><th style='padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;width:50%;'>total</th></tr><tr style='background:#fff;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>（開始）</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>0</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8fafc;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>1</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>1</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>2</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>3</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8fafc;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>3</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>6</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>4</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>10</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8fafc;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>5</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>15</td></tr></table>\n</div>\n<div style='background:#fefce8;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #f59e0b;'><p style='color:#374151;font-size:.88rem;margin:0;line-height:1.7;'> ⚠️ 變數別叫 <code style='background:#e2e8f0;color:#0f172a;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.85em;'>sum</code>：它是 Python 內建函式，蓋掉之後 <code style='background:#e2e8f0;color:#0f172a;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.85em;'>sum([1,2,3])</code> 就會出錯。</p></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 9, "title": "累加變化題", "chapter": "第二節：累加與雙重迴圈", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>🧩 累加的變化題</h2>\n<table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin-bottom:12px;'><tr style='background:#1E3A5F;color:#fff;'><th style='padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;width:46%;'>題目</th><th style='padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;width:54%;'>關鍵寫法</th></tr><tr style='background:#fff;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>3 + 6 + 9 + … + 150</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>for i in range(3, 151, 3)</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8fafc;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>1～n 的偶數和</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>for i in range(2, n + 1, 2)</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>1～n 中 7 的倍數或個位數是 7</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>if i % 7 == 0 or i % 10 == 7:</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8fafc;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>1 × 2 × 3 × … × n（n!）</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>p = 1 開始，p = p * i（乘法要從 1 開始！）</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>n + (n−1) + … + 1</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>for i in range(n, 0, -1)</td></tr></table>\n<div style='background:#eff6ff;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #2563eb;'><p style='color:#374151;font-size:.88rem;margin:0;line-height:1.7;'>💬 🧾 對應線上練習 <strong>#323 計算 1 加到 n 的值</strong>。</p></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 10, "title": "雙重迴圈", "chapter": "第二節：累加與雙重迴圈", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>🔁🔁 雙重迴圈：迴圈裡還有迴圈</h2>\n<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:12px;'><div style='background:#1e293b;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:12px;'><div style='padding:10px 14px;'><pre style='margin:0;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.6;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'>for i in range(4):          # 外圈：4 列\n    for j in range(6):      # 內圈：每列 6 個\n        print(&quot;*&quot;, end=&quot;&quot;)\n    print()                 # 換行</pre></div><div style='background:#0b1220;border-top:1px dashed #334155;padding:8px 14px;'><span style='font-size:.68rem;color:#64748b;'>▶ 執行結果</span><pre style='margin:4px 0 0;color:#a7f3d0;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.55;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'>******\n******\n******\n******</pre></div></div>\n<div style='background:#f5f3ff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;'>🕐</div><strong style='color:#5b21b6;font-size:.9rem;'>時鐘的比喻</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>外圈像<strong>時針</strong>、內圈像<strong>分針</strong>：時針走 1 格，分針要轉完一整圈。<br><br>總共執行 4 × 6 = <strong>24</strong> 次 print(\"*\")</div></div></div>\n<div style='background:#eff6ff;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #2563eb;'><p style='color:#374151;font-size:.88rem;margin:0;line-height:1.7;'>💬 💡 <code style='background:#e2e8f0;color:#0f172a;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.85em;'>print()</code> 括號裡什麼都沒有，就是「只換行」。</p></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 11, "title": "星號三角形", "chapter": "第二節：累加與雙重迴圈", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>⭐ 範例：星號三角形</h2>\n<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:12px;'><div style='background:#1e293b;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:12px;'><div style='padding:10px 14px;'><pre style='margin:0;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.6;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'>n = int(input(&quot;n=&quot;))\nfor i in range(1, n + 1):\n    for j in range(i):     # 第 i 列印 i 個\n        print(&quot;*&quot;, end=&quot;&quot;)\n    print()</pre></div><div style='background:#0b1220;border-top:1px dashed #334155;padding:8px 14px;'><span style='font-size:.68rem;color:#64748b;'>▶ 執行結果</span><pre style='margin:4px 0 0;color:#a7f3d0;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.55;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'>n=4\n*\n**\n***\n****</pre></div></div>\n<div style='background:#f0fdf4;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;'>🔺</div><strong style='color:#166534;font-size:.9rem;'>關鍵：內圈次數跟著外圈變</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>第 1 列印 1 個、第 2 列印 2 個…<br>所以內圈是 <code style='background:#e2e8f0;color:#0f172a;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.85em;'>range(i)</code>。<br><br>挑戰：改成倒三角形？或置中的金字塔？（提示：先印空白）</div></div></div>\n<div style='background:#eff6ff;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #2563eb;'><p style='color:#374151;font-size:.88rem;margin:0;line-height:1.7;'>💬 🧾 對應線上練習 <strong>#325 印出星號三角形</strong>。Python 也可以用 <code style='background:#e2e8f0;color:#0f172a;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.85em;'>print(&quot;*&quot; * i)</code> 一行完成，但要先會用迴圈想。</p></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 12, "title": "九九乘法表", "chapter": "第二節：累加與雙重迴圈", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>✖️ 範例：九九乘法表</h2>\n<div style='background:#1e293b;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:12px;'><div style='padding:10px 14px;'><div style='font-size:.72rem;color:#94a3b8;margin-bottom:6px;'>f\"{i*j:2d}\" 讓結果佔 2 格，排版才會對齊</div><pre style='margin:0;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.6;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'>for i in range(1, 10):\n    for j in range(1, 10):\n        print(f&quot;{i}x{j}={i*j:2d}&quot;, end=&quot;  &quot;)\n    print()</pre></div><div style='background:#0b1220;border-top:1px dashed #334155;padding:8px 14px;'><span style='font-size:.68rem;color:#64748b;'>▶ 執行結果</span><pre style='margin:4px 0 0;color:#a7f3d0;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.55;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'>1x1= 1  1x2= 2  1x3= 3 … 1x9= 9\n2x1= 2  2x2= 4  2x3= 6 … 2x9=18\n…\n9x1= 9  9x2=18  9x3=27 … 9x9=81</pre></div></div>\n<div style='background:#eff6ff;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #2563eb;'><p style='color:#374151;font-size:.88rem;margin:0;line-height:1.7;'>💬 🤔 想一想：如果要印成「直的」（一欄是一個數的乘法），i 和 j 要怎麼調換？</p></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 13, "title": "第二節 隨堂測驗", "chapter": "第二節：累加與雙重迴圈", "bg": "purple", "quiz": "q2", "html": "\n<div style='text-align:center;padding:44px 20px;'>\n  <div style='font-size:54px;margin-bottom:16px;'>📝</div>\n  <h1 style='font-size:2rem;color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px;'>第二節 隨堂測驗</h1>\n  <p style='color:#e9d5ff;font-size:1rem;'>累加與雙重迴圈 ｜ 4 題</p>\n  <p style='color:#c4b5fd;font-size:.85rem;margin-top:18px;'>按「下一頁 →」開始作答</p>\n</div>\n", "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 14, "title": "while 語法", "chapter": "第三節：while 與 break", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>⏳ while：條件成立就一直做</h2>\n<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:12px;'><div style='background:#1e293b;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:12px;'><div style='padding:10px 14px;'><pre style='margin:0;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.6;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'>i = 1               # ① 起始值\nwhile i &lt; 6:        # ② 條件\n    print(i)\n    i = i + 1       # ③ 更新（不能忘！）</pre></div><div style='background:#0b1220;border-top:1px dashed #334155;padding:8px 14px;'><span style='font-size:.68rem;color:#64748b;'>▶ 執行結果</span><pre style='margin:4px 0 0;color:#a7f3d0;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.55;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'>1\n2\n3\n4\n5</pre></div></div>\n<div style='background:#fef2f2;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;'>♾️</div><strong style='color:#991b1b;font-size:.9rem;'>⚠️ 無窮迴圈</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>忘了寫 <code style='background:#e2e8f0;color:#0f172a;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.85em;'>i = i + 1</code>，i 永遠是 1，條件永遠成立，程式就停不下來。<br><br>在 Colab 按儲存格左邊的 <strong>■ 停止</strong>可以中斷。</div></div></div>\n<div style='background:#eff6ff;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #2563eb;'><p style='color:#374151;font-size:.88rem;margin:0;line-height:1.7;'>💬 🧾 對應線上練習 <strong>#326 while 練習（輸出 1～5）</strong>、<strong>#327 輸出 1 加到 n</strong>。</p></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 15, "title": "for 和 while 怎麼選", "chapter": "第三節：while 與 break", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>⚖️ for 和 while 怎麼選？</h2>\n<table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin-bottom:12px;'><tr style='background:#1E3A5F;color:#fff;'><th style='padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;width:16%;'></th><th style='padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;width:42%;'>for</th><th style='padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;width:42%;'>while</th></tr><tr style='background:#fff;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>適合</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'><strong>知道要做幾次</strong></td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'><strong>不知道要做幾次</strong>，只知道何時停</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8fafc;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>例子</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>印 50 行、1 加到 n、走過串列</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>存錢到目標金額、猜數字猜對為止、輸入密碼</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>計數</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>自動</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>要自己初始化、自己更新</td></tr></table>\n<div style='background:#eff6ff;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #2563eb;'><p style='color:#374151;font-size:.88rem;margin:0;line-height:1.7;'>💬 🇹🇼 生活例子：捷運「坐 5 站」用 for；「坐到台北車站才下車」用 while。</p></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 16, "title": "while 範例：成績加分", "chapter": "第三節：while 與 break", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>📈 範例：多寫幾個作業才能達標？</h2>\n<div style='background:#f1f5f9;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:14px;border-left:4px solid #0d9488;'><p style='margin:0;color:#0f172a;font-size:.93rem;line-height:1.7;'>每多寫一個作業，成績 ×1.05（去除小數）。例如 70 → 73 → 76…。輸入起始與期望成績，輸出至少要多寫幾個。</p></div>\n<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.6fr 1fr;gap:12px;'><div style='background:#1e293b;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:12px;'><div style='padding:10px 14px;'><pre style='margin:0;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.6;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'>s = int(input(&quot;起始成績：&quot;))\ngoal = int(input(&quot;期望成績：&quot;))\ncount = 0\nwhile s &lt; goal:\n    s = int(s * 1.05)\n    count += 1\nprint(&quot;至少要多完成&quot;, count, &quot;個作業&quot;)</pre></div><div style='background:#0b1220;border-top:1px dashed #334155;padding:8px 14px;'><span style='font-size:.68rem;color:#64748b;'>▶ 執行結果</span><pre style='margin:4px 0 0;color:#a7f3d0;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.55;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'>起始成績：70\n期望成績：85\n至少要多完成 5 個作業</pre></div></div>\n<table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin-bottom:12px;'><tr style='background:#1E3A5F;color:#fff;'><th style='padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;width:50%;'>次數</th><th style='padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;width:50%;'>成績</th></tr><tr style='background:#fff;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>0</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>70</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8fafc;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>1</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>73</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>2</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>76</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8fafc;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>3</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>79</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>4</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>82</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8fafc;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>5</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>86 ✔</td></tr></table>\n</div>\n<div style='background:#eff6ff;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #2563eb;'><p style='color:#374151;font-size:.88rem;margin:0;line-height:1.7;'>💬 🧾 對應線上練習 <strong>#328 業績計算</strong>：結構相同，換成業績成長率。</p></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 17, "title": "break 與 continue", "chapter": "第三節：while 與 break", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>🛑 break 跳出、⏭️ continue 跳過</h2>\n<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;gap:12px;'><div style='background:#1e293b;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:12px;'><div style='padding:10px 14px;'><div style='font-size:.72rem;color:#94a3b8;margin-bottom:6px;'>密碼驗證：錯 3 次就鎖住</div><pre style='margin:0;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.6;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'>wrong = 0\nwhile True:                 # 先無限循環\n    pw = input(&quot;密碼：&quot;)\n    if pw == &quot;&quot;:\n        continue            # 空白不算，重來\n    if pw == &quot;fhehs2027&quot;:\n        print(&quot;登入成功&quot;)\n        break               # 跳出迴圈\n    wrong += 1\n    if wrong == 3:\n        print(&quot;拒絕存取&quot;)\n        break</pre></div><div style='background:#0b1220;border-top:1px dashed #334155;padding:8px 14px;'><span style='font-size:.68rem;color:#64748b;'>▶ 執行結果</span><pre style='margin:4px 0 0;color:#a7f3d0;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.55;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;'></pre></div></div>\n<table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin-bottom:12px;'><tr style='background:#1E3A5F;color:#fff;'><th style='padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;width:35%;'>指令</th><th style='padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;width:65%;'>作用</th></tr><tr style='background:#fff;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>break</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'><strong>立刻結束</strong>整個迴圈</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8fafc;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>continue</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'><strong>跳過</strong>這一輪剩下的部分，回到迴圈開頭</td></tr></table>\n</div>\n<div style='background:#eff6ff;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #2563eb;'><p style='color:#374151;font-size:.88rem;margin:0;line-height:1.7;'>💬 🔐 這就是手機、網站「錯太多次就鎖定」的基本原理，用來防止有人一直亂猜密碼（暴力破解）。</p></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 18, "title": "常見迴圈錯誤", "chapter": "第三節：while 與 break", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>🐞 迴圈常見錯誤</h2>\n<table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin-bottom:12px;'><tr style='background:#1E3A5F;color:#fff;'><th style='padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;width:40%;'>症狀</th><th style='padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;width:60%;'>可能原因</th></tr><tr style='background:#fff;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>少算一次（例如只加到 n−1）</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>range(1, n) 少了 +1：結束值不包含</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8fafc;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>答案是 0 或很奇怪</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>累加器放在迴圈<strong>裡面</strong>，每輪都被歸零</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>乘積永遠是 0</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>乘法的累乘器從 0 開始，應該從 1 開始</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8fafc;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>程式停不下來</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>while 的條件變數沒有更新</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>只印出最後一個結果</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>print 沒有縮排在迴圈裡（或反過來）</td></tr></table>\n<div style='background:#eff6ff;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #2563eb;'><p style='color:#374151;font-size:.88rem;margin:0;line-height:1.7;'>💬 🔍 除錯法寶：在迴圈裡加一行 <code style='background:#e2e8f0;color:#0f172a;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.85em;'>print(i, total)</code>，看每一輪變數怎麼變——就是程式版的追蹤表。</p></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 19, "title": "第三節 隨堂測驗", "chapter": "第三節：while 與 break", "bg": "purple", "quiz": "q3", "html": "\n<div style='text-align:center;padding:44px 20px;'>\n  <div style='font-size:54px;margin-bottom:16px;'>📝</div>\n  <h1 style='font-size:2rem;color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px;'>第三節 隨堂測驗</h1>\n  <p style='color:#e9d5ff;font-size:1rem;'>while 與 break ｜ 4 題</p>\n  <p style='color:#c4b5fd;font-size:.85rem;margin-top:18px;'>按「下一頁 →」開始作答</p>\n</div>\n", "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 20, "title": "本週實作", "chapter": "實作與總結", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>✏️ 本週實作：Colab ＋ 線上練習</h2>\n<div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;background:#fff7ed;border:1px solid #fed7aa;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px;'><div style='font-size:2rem;'>📓</div><div style='flex:1;'><strong style='color:#9a3412;font-size:.9rem;'>第 4 課 Colab 練習（7 題）</strong><div style='font-size:.78rem;color:#475569;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.6;'>50 行 Hello、1 加到 n、累加變化題、星號三角形、九九乘法表、成績加分、密碼驗證</div></div><a href='https://colab.research.google.com/github/fhehshs/city-tech-115-2/blob/main/notebooks/py04_loops.ipynb' target='_blank' rel='noopener' style='background:#f9ab00;color:#1f2937;font-weight:700;font-size:.82rem;padding:9px 16px;border-radius:20px;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;'>在 Colab 開啟 ↗</a></div>\n<div style='background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px;'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;'><strong style='color:#166534;font-size:.9rem;'>💻 線上練習（Online Judge）</strong><a href='http://103.226.213.97/course/view.php?id=2109' target='_blank' rel='noopener' style='background:#16a34a;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:.78rem;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:18px;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;'>前往練習網站 ↗</a></div><ul style='margin:8px 0 0 18px;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;line-height:1.6;'><li style='margin-bottom:3px;'><strong>#320、#322、#324</strong> range()、for 雙重迴圈觀念（測驗）</li><li style='margin-bottom:3px;'><strong>#321</strong> for 練習：輸出 50 行字串（VPL）</li><li style='margin-bottom:3px;'><strong>#323</strong> 計算 1 加到 n 的值（VPL）</li><li style='margin-bottom:3px;'><strong>#325</strong> 印出星號三角形（VPL）</li><li style='margin-bottom:3px;'><strong>#326、#327</strong> while 練習（VPL）</li><li style='margin-bottom:3px;'><strong>#328</strong> 業績計算（VPL）</li></ul><div style='font-size:.72rem;color:#64748b;margin-top:6px;'>課程：115芳和高中資訊科技Py ｜ VPL 題送出後系統會自動「評估」給分</div></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 21, "title": "本週總結", "chapter": "實作與總結", "bg": "navy", "html": "\n<h2 style='color:#fff;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:14px;'>📌 本週重點</h2>\n<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;'><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:10px;padding:13px;'><strong style='color:#93c5fd;font-size:.9rem;'>for + range()</strong><p style='color:#e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;margin-top:5px;line-height:1.7;'>知道次數用 for；range 的結束值不包含</p></div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:10px;padding:13px;'><strong style='color:#93c5fd;font-size:.9rem;'>累加器</strong><p style='color:#e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;margin-top:5px;line-height:1.7;'>迴圈前歸零（乘法從 1），迴圈中累加</p></div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:10px;padding:13px;'><strong style='color:#93c5fd;font-size:.9rem;'>雙重迴圈</strong><p style='color:#e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;margin-top:5px;line-height:1.7;'>外圈控制列、內圈控制每列內容</p></div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:10px;padding:13px;'><strong style='color:#93c5fd;font-size:.9rem;'>while / break</strong><p style='color:#e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;margin-top:5px;line-height:1.7;'>不知道次數用 while；記得更新條件</p></div></div>\n<div style='background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(13,148,136,.35),rgba(107,63,160,.35));border-radius:10px;padding:16px 20px;text-align:center;'>\n  <p style='color:#fff;font-size:1.02rem;font-weight:700;margin:0;'>「重複的事交給迴圈，人只要想清楚規則。」</p>\n  <p style='color:#cbd5e1;font-size:.82rem;margin-top:6px;'>下一章：學習挑戰——綜合題目大練兵</p>\n</div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}]